    <div class="practice-grid"><article class="practice-card"><span class="card-index">01</span><h3>Criminal Litigation &amp; Defence</h3><p>Trial defence, charge sheet scrutiny, cross-examination and criminal appeals before Sessions Courts and the Rajasthan High Court.</p><a class="text-link" href="/practice-areas/criminal-law/">Explore Criminal Law</a></article><article class="practice-card"><span class="card-index">02</span><h3>Bail &amp; Anticipatory Bail</h3><p>Regular and anticipatory bail, interim protection and bail under special statutes such as NDPS, POCSO and the PC Act.</p><a class="text-link" href="/practice-areas/criminal-law/">Explore Bail Practice</a></article><article class="practice-card"><span class="card-index">03</span><h3>Criminal Investigation Advisory</h3><p>Legal review of investigation records, case diaries and evidence, drawing on 35 years of police experience.</p><a class="text-link" href="/investigation-expertise/">Explore Investigation Advisory</a></article><article class="practice-card"><span class="card-index">04</span><h3>Constitutional &amp; Writ Litigation</h3><p>Writ petitions under Articles 226 and 227 before the Rajasthan High Court, including challenges to arbitrary administrative action.</p><a class="text-link" href="/practice-areas/writ-jurisdiction/">Explore Writ Petitions</a></article><article class="practice-card"><span class="card-index">05</span><h3>Special Criminal Courts</h3><p>Proceedings before Special NDPS, POCSO, Anti-Corruption, SC/ST Act and CBI Courts and Juvenile Justice Boards.</p><a class="text-link" href="/courts-and-forums/">View Courts &amp; Forums</a></article><article class="practice-card"><span class="card-index">06</span><h3>Cyber Law &amp; Technology Offences</h3><p>Advice and representation on cyber offences, digital evidence verification and technology disputes.</p></article><article class="practice-card"><span class="card-index">07</span><h3>Consumer Protection &amp; Negotiable Instruments</h3><p>Cheque dishonour complaints under Section 138 and matters before Consumer Disputes Redressal Commissions.</p></article><article class="practice-card"><span class="card-index">08</span><h3>Family &amp; Matrimonial Law</h3><p>Matrimonial disputes, maintenance, domestic violence matters and custody, handled with sensitivity.</p></article><article class="practice-card"><span class="card-index">09</span><h3>Corporate Law &amp; IPR</h3><p>Selected corporate advisory, trademark, copyright and intellectual property matters.</p></article><article class="practice-card"><span class="card-index">10</span><h3>Professional Support for Advocates</h3><p>Case-record review, trial strategy and forensic consultation for fellow advocates and law firms.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Connect</a></article></div>
